# Runtime /trade-ticket output (TICKET-010). Operator-managed; never committed.
# Default location is HERMES_TRADE_TICKET_DIR=${HOME}/trading-research/tickets,
# but the *.ticket.yaml suffix matches the bundle's suggested basename
# (<ticket_id>.ticket.yaml) so an accidental in-repo save is caught here too.
# `reports/` above already protects the cron output convention.
tickets/
*.ticket.yaml
